      "content": "hey, i have type 1 diabetes and i feel really weird right now. im super shaky and sweaty and kinda confused... i checked my sugar like an hour ago and it was a bit high (180), so i think im just crashing from the spike. should i just take an extra unit of my rapid insulin now to steady it out before it gets worse?",
